{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2024-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1723766400, "end_date": 1724457599, "month_true_total": 93, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:00:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "173134643", "author": {"steamid": "76561199172188289", "personaname": "Kahuna", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BigBoiKahuna/", "num_games_owned": 109, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 3669, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3669, "last_played": 1724438779, "avatar": "e4c5e2ab869df41657cb2108f0d01723d0ba7ba7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I had a huge review written, steam deleted it, so I'll sum it up.\r\nMain campaign sucked, not interesting until 3/4 of the way through. Side characters were interesting besides Liam and Cora, who both sucked. Gameplay was just meh overall. \r\nI was left wanting more ALL THE TIME, missions end when they start to get good. Loyalty missions are the most interesting thing in this game, and that's saying a lot.\r\nI finished the game because I had played it for 4 hours and couldn't refund it. \r\nI won't say I suffered through, but I didn't enjoy it nearly as much as I wanted to.\r\nDon't play it, it's been called the worst Mass Effect by many, it earned that title.", "timestamp_created": 1724440391, "timestamp_updated": 1724440391, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505494534969329834", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173131549", "author": {"steamid": "76561199484188099", "personaname": "Anamesia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199484188099/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "play