 lead nowhere. travel across the universe many times just to say hello and some game bugs kind of take the fun out of it.", "timestamp_created": 1724367922, "timestamp_updated": 1724367922, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172986285", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041173375", "personaname": "JacquesPatat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/JacquesPatat/", "num_games_owned": 1022, "num_reviews": 120, "playtime_forever": 3068, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3068, "last_played": 1724261141, "avatar": "816ff4762198be854a9c78e5370a3af8272caea2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game was fun, combat mechanics have been improved over previous games, Story for me, seemed good but not great. there are a few things which didn't annoy me but was noticeable, lip syncing when characters talk is weird, not always in sync or mouth not moving but character is talking, Another thing is when ship lands and character walks out the ship, sometimes the character wont be wearing a helmet or certain armour parts for few seconds then it will be on. there are a few small things like visual problems but overall can be easily ignored. The ending was little bit anticlimactic, all the action and fighting then the boss fight happened and some talking afterwards, i was like, was that it. I mean it kind of felt like there should more or i'm missing something, even when i have only a couple of side mission left", "timestamp_created": 1724337963, "timestamp_updated": 1724337963, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52649003267288208", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}